d unremarkable cut surface  The remaining parenchyma of the specimen contains tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue with no discrete mass or lesion  The upper outer quadrant tissue is also palpated for lymph nodes and no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   First biopsy site  entirely submitted  with closest margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Second biopsy site  entirely submitted  with closest margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the breast parenchyma between the 2 biopsy sites   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the breast parenchyma of the upper inner quadrant  Received fresh  labeled with  right breast  stitch at 12 o clock   is a 26 x 21 x 3 5cm oriented right simple mastectomy specimen with a stitch at 12 o clock  The anterior surface contains a REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm unremarkable areola and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm nipple  which contains a REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan brown papilliferous skin nodule  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior   blue  posterior   black  The specimen is serially sectioned along the medial lateral axis to reveal a predominantly tan yellow lobulated cut surface interspersed with a moderate amount of tan white rubbery fibrous tissue  No discrete mass or lesion is noted  The upper outer quadrant tissue is also palpated for lymph nodes and no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Representative sections of the breast parenchyma are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma of the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma of the upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma of the central quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the breast parenchyma of the upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the