iewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses               ADDENDUM NOTE   REASON   2 RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH   FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION    Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified    See note     Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  100  to  chromosome 17 signals  95  in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than  2 0 or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for  chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis     The results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be  interpreted with caution  Equivocal Amplification   Reference  Journal of  Clinical Oncology 25 118 145   REMOVED_CASE_ID        Addendum  2 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH  02   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 08 44PM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses     PART   Breast  Right   Core biopsy       report_end  , Absent.
