erior and inferior margins  E H  Additional sections range from medial to lateral including nodular areas in all sections  I  One axillary lymph node  1 5 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm    quadrasected  J  One axillary lymph node  1 5 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm    bisected  K  One axillary lymph node  1 0 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm    bisected  L  One axillary lymph node  1 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5   bisected  M  Four axillary lymph nodes  0 8 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm    whole  N  Two axillary lymph nodes  1 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE    whole  O  Axillary cyst  1 0 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9   quadrasected  P Y Additional breast tissue sections  Resident  STEWART M  KNOEPP  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   LYMPH NODE LEFT A , Absent.
